<title>UK: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP COLLATED SCORES.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP COLLATED SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest collated scores in Davis</p>
<p>Cup tennis matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group one play-off</p>
<p>In Kiev: Britain lead Ukraine 2-1</p>
<p>American zone group one play-offs</p>
<p>In Nassau: Bahamas and Venezuela level 1-1</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: Ecuador lead Argentina 2-1</p>
<p>Asia/Oceanina group one play-off</p>
<p>In Tashkent: Japan lead Uzbekistan 2-1</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group two, second round</p>
<p>In Nova Gorica: Norway lead Slovenia 2-1</p>
<p>In Porto: Portugal lead Yugoslavia 2-1</p>
<p>In Bytom: Poland lead Ivory Coast 2-1</p>
<p>In Tampere: Finland lead Belarus 2-1</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group one play-offs</p>
<p>In Tbilisi: Georgia lead Nigeria 3-0</p>
<p>In Cairo: Egypt lead Lithuania 2-1</p>
<p>In Jurmala: Latvia lead Ghana 3-0</p>
<p>In Dublin: Ireland lead Greece 2-1</p>
</text>
